<item><title>Egypt directs $1.5 billion IMF tranche to central bank reserves</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-directs-1-5-billion-imf-tranche-to-central-bank-fa31bd/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-directs-1-5-billion-imf-tranche-to-central-bank-fa31bd/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The final review clears a combined $2.3 billion disbursement, including $800 million for green, water-management and renewable-energy reforms.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:52:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-directs-1-5-billion-imf-tranche-to-central-bank-fa31bd/share.jpg" length="41197" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-directs-1-5-billion-imf-tranche-to-central-bank-fa31bd/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Egypt and Syria sign aviation deal after 14 years without direct flights</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-and-syria-sign-aviation-deal-after-14-years-without-96ecc4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-and-syria-sign-aviation-deal-after-14-years-without-96ecc4/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The agreement enables technical exchanges and airport-procedure work, while Egyptian authorities have inspected Damascus and Aleppo airports.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:28:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
